# ---- Cross-platform OS breadcrumbs (git-prep portability guard) ----
# Windows marks downloads with an NTFS Zone.Identifier stream; copied into WSL it becomes a
# literal `<file>:Zone.Identifier` path that Windows git refuses to check out.
*:Zone.Identifier
Thumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
._*
